      "message": "Actually, this looks to be just the compiler. If I make things \"volatile\" I don\u0027t get 0x123 here... So to summarize:\n* reading / writing to NULL doesn\u0027t cause a fault (but probably should?)\n* reading from NULL just reads back from the ROM\n* writing to NULL is ignored.",
